comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-01T20:20:19.401Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: all-status searches found closed pm-mp49 as the exact historical owner plus closed core sentinel work pm-i02t; no active recurrence exists. Live 2026-08-01 reproduction: explicit --status all fails while omission considers all 2,263 items. --allow-duplicate is used only to represent this versioned regression without rewriting or reopening the immutable completion record."
  "2026-08-01T20:21:53.634Z","harness:codex","Planning note: fix ownership belongs in the shared lifecycle-filter parser and package action contract, not as another local special case. Verification must include source tests plus a freshly packed installed package because the historical item passed at that boundary and current source behavior regressed. The regression should also reply to the misleading recovery path by making allowed values include the all sentinel when the command supports it."
  "2026-08-01T20:25:23.985Z","harness:codex","Organization evidence: this is the only active owner of the 2026.8.1 recurrence. Exact-title dedupe remains unchanged from the historical canceled probe cluster and parent-scope dedupe has zero clusters. pm-4flipp was consolidated into this item through pm dedupe-merge with duplicate_of metadata after delayed command output revealed the first create had succeeded."
